abstract: >-
  MEDIQ is a continuously growing, bilingual (Hindi-English) question-answering
  dataset collected from a real-world AI chatbot deployed at a public Indian
  medical university. It captures authentic user queries about medical education,
  hospital services, admissions, appointments, and university administration.
  The dataset includes AI-enriched metadata: corrected language detection
  (including Romanized Hindi), intent classification, medical relevance scoring,
  sentiment analysis, answer quality assessment, and topic tagging.
  The dataset contains zero personally identifiable information and is fully
  compliant with India's DPDP Act 2023.
